            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Aki 0.14.0</h2><h3>New</h3><ul>
<li><b>+ New</b> on the marking card: no terminal open yet? Open Claude or Codex in a new Orca tab, or a new conversation in the Claude or Codex app, in the project you pick, with your marks as its first message.</li>
<li><b>Pick several marks in History</b>: tick the box at the start of each row (shift-click ticks every mark in between), then send them all to one session, mark them done or delete them together.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
