            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Aki 0.14.0-beta.7</h2><h3>New</h3><ul>
<li>"+ New" on the marking card: open Claude or Codex in a new Orca tab, or a new conversation in their apps, in the project you pick, with your marks as its first message. No need to open a terminal first.</li>
<li>History picks several marks at once with the tick box at the start of each row (shift-click ticks every mark in between): send them all to one terminal, mark them done or delete them together.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
