        <item>
            <title>0.13.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:47:57 -0300</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>20261121234757</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.13.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Aki 0.13.0</h2><h3>New</h3><ul>
<li>Limit resets in the Claude and Codex cards: use one of Codex's right from Aki (it asks first), or go straight to Claude's usage page to use one there.</li>
</ul><h3>Fixes</h3><ul>
<li>With more than one display, only the screen you're on holds still while a hover menu is kept, as with the Mac's ⌘⇧4: the others keep running.</li>
<li>A localhost page served from a Claude session's own scratchpad folder goes to that session, whatever its tab is called.</li>
<li>Claude's usage ring follows the session that talked to Claude last: after you reset your limit it kept showing the old share.</li>
<li>The list of more terminals fits its card: with many sessions its top was cut off.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://aki-updates.vercel.app/0.13.0/Aki-0.13.0.zip" length="4414386" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="VM+ZyJl55H23xGKDs6mQouZWSGb1B2o2LgzzmBa+UZNCfTi2h8l4n4k/McEvZyyS/NxxTEq1R86Ucu3nxUe8DA=="/>
        </item>
