            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Aki 0.12.2</h2><h3>Fixes</h3><ul>
<li>A page's hover menu stays on screen when marking opens, as with the Mac's ⌘⇧4: the screen holds still at once, instead of the menu vanishing and coming back.</li>
<li>Claude's usage ring shows the newest share of the limit: a session left idle kept showing an older, lower number.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
